        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;When a verb is done (CLAUDE.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;It ships whole or not at all: its doc, native hook, SP binding, message, validator, server logic, client handler, T0 and T2 tests and a T3 scenario; a partial verb lives on a branch, never on main (rule 3). It is done at T3 with a green scenario and no HYPOTHESIS tags left. The scenario runner is the only thing that marks green; neither the agent nor a person marks a verb done by hand (ADR-009)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:68-70 (hard rule 3), :155 (Testing tiers); docs/DECISIONS.md:99-105 (ADR-009)" id="lc1-done">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="1190" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1. Where a verb comes from&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:96 (workflow 1); docs/PLAN.md:72-78" id="lc1-src">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="182" width="270" height="226" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1a. A playtest finding&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Eli plays both seats over Moonlight from a checklist in docs/private (playtest-m2-14.md): he ticks [x] when a check holds and writes what is odd under it. A finding becomes a docs/PLAN.md bullet and a section of its verb doc (Held, Found)." tooltip="Source: docs/private/playtest-m2-14.md:1-32 (the checklist, the tick); docs/PLAN.md:952-968 (Found in playtest fourteen); docs/verbs/spell-cast.md:430, docs/verbs/shouts.md:408 (Playtest fourteen)" id="lc1-s1a">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-src">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="28" width="250" height="89" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-s1a-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;ELI&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B85450;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-s1a">
          <mxGeometry x="218" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1b. A docs/PLAN.md item&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The current milestone's next verb, in the order Eli set on its decisions form (M2: docs/private/decisions-m2.md, 2026-10-09). A milestone is done when its scenario set is green and no verb in it carries a HYPOTHESIS tag." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:96 (workflow 1); docs/PLAN.md:72-78 (Milestones), :858-865 (Decisions taken)" id="lc1-s1b">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-src">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="127" width="250" height="89" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;2. Pick the next verb&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From the current milestone in docs/PLAN.md. Decisions already made live in docs/DECISIONS.md: a session does not relitigate one; a reversal is a new ADR that supersedes it." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:7-9, :96 (workflow 1); docs/DECISIONS.md:3-4" id="lc1-pick">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="312" y="210" width="190" height="101" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;3. /verb &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The skill in .claude/skills/verb creates docs/verbs/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.md from docs/VERB.md and greps CommonLibSSE-NG, Skyrim Platform, skymp/ROADMAP.md and docs/NATIVES.md for candidates. No code until the doc exists." tooltip="Source: .claude/skills/verb/SKILL.md:1-24; CLAUDE.md:97-99 (workflow 2)" id="lc1-scaf">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="526" y="210" width="250" height="89" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;4. The verb doc, docs/verbs/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.md&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filled before code, in VERB.md's order: Intent; Authority (the rung, R0 to R3, and why not the one above); Engine surface (file:line or UNKNOWN); Observe, Impose, Suppress; Message contract; Server; Client; Tests (T0 to T3 and the scenario id); Dynamic plan; Status. The doc is the PR body, read against VERB.md's reviewer checklist." tooltip="Source: docs/VERB.md:1-107; .claude/skills/verb/SKILL.md:20-24; CLAUDE.md:111 (workflow 8)" id="lc1-doc">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="800" y="182" width="410" height="89" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;5. Static and dynamic reads&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The RE loop has its own diagram, docs/architecture/thuum-re-loop.drawio. Static: CommonLibSSE-NG's file:line, then addrlib, then Ghidra through the re-analyst; nothing from memory (rule 1); a decompiler's reading is a HYPOTHESIS (rule 2). Dynamic: a Frida trace in a lab run (the agent) or an x64dbg session (Eli). Blocked on in-game behavior: write the Dynamic plan and stop (rule 8); still unconfirmed after one lab run: hand the plan to Eli and wait (workflow 7)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:61-67 (rules 1, 2), :78-80 (rule 8), :100-101 (workflow 3), :110 (workflow 7); docs/VERB.md:21-25, :77-83; docs/DECISIONS.md:51-58 (ADR-004); docs/LAB.md:587-605 (Dynamic RE lane)" id="lc1-reads">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DDDDDD;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="930" y="315" width="280" height="138" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6. Build inside out, on a fork branch&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:102-105 (workflow 4), :68-70 (rule 3); docs/DECISIONS.md:107-131 (ADR-010); memory feedback-no-force-push.md (stacked branches take merges)" id="lc1-build">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="452" width="890" height="229" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="A branch m&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;verb&amp;gt;, stacked on its base. Server first: the only layer with a fast oracle. New server code is Rust (ADR-010); C++ handlers are legacy (workflow 4)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:102-105 (workflow 4); docs/DECISIONS.md:107-131 (ADR-010); memory feedback-no-force-push.md" id="lc1-bsub">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-build">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="24" width="870" height="27" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6a. Server logic: the rule&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A pure Rust function in wire-rules over a struct of facts, returning a decision and the bound it used (ADR-020); cargo tests in seconds." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:401-428 (ADR-020); CLAUDE.md:102-105" id="lc1-b6a1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-build">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="57" width="205" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6a. Server logic: the handler, T0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The C++ core gathers the facts from the world model and asks the rule through wire-bridge; its unit test lands with it (PoisonTest, ShoutsTest)." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:414-418 (ADR-020); docs/verbs/poison.md:116-131 (Server), :283; docs/verbs/shouts.md (Status: ShoutsTest)" id="lc1-b6a2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-build">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="143" width="205" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6b. The message and its validator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A message is a bounded Rust type in wire-schema, recognized in Rust before anything else sees it (ADR-012, rule 12). Widening the wire updates the contract and the validator in the same commit (rule 4). Often no new message: poison rides OnEquip." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:71-72 (rule 4), :87-89 (rule 12); docs/DECISIONS.md:168-183 (ADR-012); docs/verbs/poison.md:105-114 (Message contract)" id="lc1-b6b">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-build">
            <mxGeometry x="225" y="57" width="205" height="162" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6c. The Skyrim Platform native hook&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filtered in native before it crosses into JS (rule 9). A new Papyrus native, delegation or stub gets its docs/NATIVES.md line and rung (rule 10). Poison: a sink on the engine's PoisonedWeapon event." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:81-85 (rules 9, 10); docs/verbs/poison.md:133-140 (Client)" id="lc1-b6c">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-build">
            <mxGeometry x="440" y="57" width="205" height="162" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;6d. The TS handler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;skymp5-client sends the intent and renders the server's decision (poison: onPoisonApplied sends OnEquip; the inventory brings the mark back). Each verb names a kill switch key." tooltip="Source: docs/VERB.md:63-67 (Client); docs/verbs/poison.md:141-144, :287" id="lc1-b6d">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-build">
            <mxGeometry x="655" y="57" width="205" height="162" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The gates&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:142-155 (Testing tiers); docs/DECISIONS.md:99-105 (ADR-009); docs/LAB.md:613" id="lc1-gates">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="725" width="1150" height="171" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="Each green before the next. Only lab-api marks a scenario green (ADR-009). A red goes back to the branch as a new commit; a scenario that fails twice reopens its verb (docs/LAB.md)." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:99-105 (ADR-009); docs/LAB.md:613; CLAUDE.md:106 (workflow 5)" id="lc1-gsub">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-gates">
            <mxGeometry x="190" y="3" width="950" height="27" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;T0 unit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;just test: ctest in the server's build image. just wire-test: cargo test, clippy with the deny set, cargo deny, the committed C header. On each push to an m&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;- branch the fork's CI server-build builds the server, runs ctest inside the build (given the masters) and pushes skymp-server:&amp;lt;branch&amp;gt;. Green before any lab time (workflow 5).&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ticks: server logic + T0.&lt;/i&gt;" tooltip="Source: justfile:46-48 (test), :416-418 (wire-test); skymp/.gitlab-ci.yml:1-4, :44-55 (wire-test), :90-149 (server-build); CLAUDE.md:106 (workflow 5), :144" id="lc1-t0">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-gates">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="35" width="252" height="126" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-t0-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;T0&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-t0">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;T1 host-less native&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CommonLib plugin code loaded against SkyrimSE.exe outside the game: offsets and layouts resolve. Windows-only, on a lab client; no just recipe of its own. M2's verb docs record T1 none.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ticks: native hook + T1.&lt;/i&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:145-146; justfile:45; docs/verbs/poison.md:152, :285-286; docs/verbs/spell-cast.md (Status: native hook + T1)" id="lc1-t1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-gates">
            <mxGeometry x="270" y="35" width="186" height="126" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-t1-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;T1&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-t1">
          <mxGeometry x="154" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;T2 protocol&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;just test-proto &amp;lt;tag&amp;gt; on sky-srv, with the branch's server image: the fakeclient smoke checked through labState; attributes across a restart; then every difftest session, each from the clean world, replayed into the legacy RakNet stack and the wire stack and diffed. A difference the port means to make is declared in the session with its counts and a reason, and reviewed like a validator change. ONLY=&amp;lt;session&amp;gt; ends &quot;T2 partial&quot;, never green: a verb's T2 is every session.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ticks: T2 green.&lt;/i&gt;" tooltip="Source: justfile:61-63; lab/tools/test-proto.sh:1-26, :178-204; docs/WIRE.md:214-248 (Differential harness); docs/DECISIONS.md:259-278 (ADR-017), :107-131 (ADR-010)" id="lc1-t2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-gates">
            <mxGeometry x="464" y="35" width="330" height="126" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-t2-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;T2&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-t2">
          <mxGeometry x="298" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;T3 lab&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Staging: the branch's Windows client and server image on sky-srv and both clones, then a stacked snapshot clean-m1-next on each. Probes by path (just lab-run &amp;lt;path&amp;gt;; an x- probe never lives in lab/scenarios). The verb's scenario on 1.6.1170 plus smoke-two-players (ADR-025), green twice by path, then committed alone for Eli's review (rule 13; thuum CI's scenario-gate refuses a mixed commit). Each run's results update the HYPOTHESIS tags (workflow 6).&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ticks: T3 scenario green, no HYPOTHESIS tags.&lt;/i&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:90-92 (rule 13), :107-109 (workflow 6), :151-152; justfile:125-129, :149-154; docs/DECISIONS.md:611-614 (ADR-025), :253-257 (ADR-016); .gitlab-ci.yml:95-97 (scenario-gate); docs/verbs/poison.md:291-292; stage-branch.sh (session scratchpad)" id="lc1-t3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-gates">
            <mxGeometry x="802" y="35" width="334" height="126" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-t3-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;T3&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-t3">
          <mxGeometry x="302" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The merge&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:560-580 (ADR-024), :671-701 (ADR-027)" id="lc1-merge">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="944" width="1150" height="159" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="The full sweep runs once, at the merge, not per verb; the merge commit names its runs, so &quot;green at merge&quot; stays checkable (ADR-024). The agent runs it, start to finish." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:571-580 (ADR-024); merge-m2-visuals.sh (session scratchpad)" id="lc1-msub">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-merge">
            <mxGeometry x="240" y="3" width="900" height="27" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;7. The merge sweep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every scenario in lab/scenarios on the branch's staged build, on 1.6.1170: 40 today. A red blocks the merge. A run without a verdict (a lab error) reruns once (the merge script's rule). A lone red that was green on the branch and reruns green twice with nothing changed becomes a watch item with a HYPOTHESIS in the verb doc (ADR-027); the same red in either of the next two sweeps is a bug. Several reds stop it." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:560-580 (ADR-024), :671-701 (ADR-027), :611-614 (ADR-025); lab/scenarios (40 files on main 444238d); merge-m2-visuals.sh:4-6, :45-65 (session scratchpad)" id="lc1-m1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-merge">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="35" width="300" height="114" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;8. Full T2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Once the fork's pipeline for the swept head is green: just test-proto &amp;lt;branch&amp;gt; must end &quot;T2 green&quot;." tooltip="Source: merge-m2-visuals.sh:66-73 (session scratchpad); lab/tools/test-proto.sh:198-204" id="lc1-m2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-merge">
            <mxGeometry x="318" y="35" width="156" height="114" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-m2-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;T2&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-m2">
          <mxGeometry x="124" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;9. parity fast-forward&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The branch head is pushed to the fork's parity only when parity is its ancestor. No force push, no amend or rebase of a pushed commit; a stacked branch takes its base by a merge." tooltip="Source: merge-m2-visuals.sh:74-76 (session scratchpad); memory feedback-no-force-push.md; docs/DECISIONS.md:243-245 (ADR-016: parity is ours)" id="lc1-m3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-merge">
            <mxGeometry x="482" y="35" width="214" height="114" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;10. Snapshots promoted&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;just client-promote on sky-c1 and sky-c2: the staged clean-m1-next becomes clean-m1, which later runs roll back to. A change that touches every client gets the full sweep first (ADR-024)." tooltip="Source: justfile:131-133; merge-m2-visuals.sh:77-80 (session scratchpad); docs/DECISIONS.md:575-576 (ADR-024)" id="lc1-m4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-merge">
            <mxGeometry x="704" y="35" width="206" height="114" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;11. thuum's merge commit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The skymp submodule at the new parity; just ledger regenerates docs/NATIVES.md from the fork, keeping its hand columns (Rung, Reason, Verb); docs/PLAN.md's DONE line with the sweep's runs; the verb doc's Status closed." tooltip="Source: justfile:101-103; docs/NATIVES.md:3-6; thuum commits ac78ed6, cb45398, 26de810 (MERGED); docs/DECISIONS.md:578-580 (ADR-024)" id="lc1-m5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-merge">
            <mxGeometry x="918" y="35" width="210" height="114" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;12. T4 playtest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Eli on both seats over Moonlight, on the new parity, from a checklist the agent writes (docs/private/playtest-&amp;lt;m&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;.md): an item per new behavior and per scenario awaiting approval. What does not hold becomes a finding (1a)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:153; docs/private/playtest-m2-14.md:1-32; playtest-m2-15.md:101-112 (session scratchpad draft); memory feedback-scenario-approval.md, thuum-m2.md" id="lc1-p1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="1151" width="430" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-p1-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;T4&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-p1">
          <mxGeometry x="368" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lc1-p1-b1" value="&lt;b&gt;ELI&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B85450;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-p1">
          <mxGeometry x="398" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;13. Scenario approved&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;When its playtest item works in Eli's hands (his rule, 2026-10-12). Each entry in docs/private/reviews-pending.md names its playtest item and whether it held; the tick is his alone (ADR-009). Eli is the required approver for lab/scenarios/ (ADR-016)." tooltip="Source: docs/private/reviews-pending.md:1-16; memory feedback-scenario-approval.md; docs/DECISIONS.md:99-105 (ADR-009), :253-257 (ADR-016)" id="lc1-p2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="880" y="1151" width="330" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-p2-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;ELI&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B85450;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-p2">
          <mxGeometry x="298" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Who decides&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:7-9, :94-111; docs/DECISIONS.md:3-4" id="lc1-who">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1230" y="224" width="570" height="225" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Eli&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ADRs: a session proposes one; Eli accepts it, and its Status records his word (ADR-024: &quot;please yes that's great&quot;; ADR-027: his M2 form). ADR-029 is proposed and waits on his call.&lt;br&gt;• Decisions forms, docs/private/decisions-*.md: a box per question (decisions-m2.md, 2026-10-09: M2's order, ADR-027 and ADR-028).&lt;br&gt;• Scenario approvals: the required approver for lab/scenarios/, once the playtest item works.&lt;br&gt;• Playtests (T4), and an x64dbg session when a Dynamic plan needs eyes." tooltip="Source: docs/DECISIONS.md:3-4, :562 (ADR-024 Status), :742-748 (ADR-029 Status), :253-257 (ADR-016); docs/PLAN.md:858-865; docs/private/decisions-m2.md:1-8; docs/VERB.md:83 (Owner); memory feedback-scenario-approval.md" id="lc1-eli">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-who">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="28" width="550" height="101" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc1-eli-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;ELI&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B85450;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-eli">
          <mxGeometry x="518" y="3" width="26" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;The agent: everything else&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Picks the verb in Eli's order; writes the doc, the code and the tests; runs T0 to T3; commits each scenario alone; runs the merge; regenerates the ledger; updates PLAN; writes the next playtest's checklist.&lt;br&gt;Never: marks green by hand (ADR-009), weakens an assertion (rule 13), ticks Eli's boxes, force pushes or rewrites a pushed commit (stacked branches take merges)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:94-111 (Workflow per verb), :90-92 (rule 13); docs/DECISIONS.md:99-105 (ADR-009); memory feedback-scenario-approval.md, feedback-no-force-push.md, thuum-m2.md" id="lc1-agent">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-who">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="139" width="550" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Hard rules on this path (CLAUDE.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3: a verb ships whole; a partial verb lives on a branch, never on main.&lt;br&gt;4: the wire never widens without the message contract and the validator in the same commit.&lt;br&gt;10: every new Papyrus native, delegation or stub gets a docs/NATIVES.md line with its rung; a stub without one does not merge.&lt;br&gt;13: scenario YAML in commits of its own, reviewed by Eli; never green by a weakened assertion; CI refuses a commit that mixes a scenario with other files.&lt;br&gt;On the RE loop: 1 (nothing from memory), 2 (a decompiler's reading is a HYPOTHESIS), 8 (blocked: the Dynamic plan, then stop)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md:59-92 (Hard rules)" id="lc1-rules">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1230" y="471" width="570" height="126" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;VERB.md's Status, ticked along the path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[ ] doc complete, rung declared (4)&lt;br&gt;[ ] engine surface cited or delegated (5)&lt;br&gt;[ ] server logic + T0 (6a, T0)&lt;br&gt;[ ] message + validator, same commit (6b)&lt;br&gt;[ ] native hook + T1 (6c, T1)&lt;br&gt;[ ] TS handler (6d)&lt;br&gt;[ ] T2 green (T2: every session)&lt;br&gt;[ ] T3 scenario green, no HYPOTHESIS tags (T3)&lt;br&gt;[ ] ledger and suppression registry updated (11, at the merge)" tooltip="Source: docs/VERB.md:85-95; docs/verbs/poison.md:275-293 (the ledger box: at the merge)" id="lc1-status">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1230" y="619" width="570" height="138" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;VERB.md's reviewer checklist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 Is the rung right, and the reason for not one higher real? 2 Does every address come from CommonLib, addrlib or a Ghidra reference? 3 Any state the verb creates off a rung? 4 Does the validator reject the obvious forgery (wrong owner, out of range, too frequent)? 5 Does the restart scenario exist and pass? 6 Are the HYPOTHESIS tags gone, cleared by evidence? 7 Is the suppression reversible on host handoff? 8 Did the ledger change if a native did?" tooltip="Source: docs/VERB.md:97-107; CLAUDE.md:111 (workflow 8)" id="lc1-rev">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1230" y="779" width="570" height="76" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
