        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Where tonight stands, 01:40 PDT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;m2-poison passed its own gates: T0, its T2 session, b-poison green twice and committed alone; its full T2 comes with the merge. m2-visuals: the first staging's probes ran; the second staging of 31b56fc9 is through its builds and snapshots, and of its probes x-dual-cast3 was not green while x-shout-relay, x-uf-ethereal, x-snap-probe2 and x-self-visuals were, x-target-spells running; three commits since (0f4e3b75, ae8446a9, be69bf68) answer what they read. Pending, in order: the third staging of be69bf68, the merge sweep of 40, the full T2, parity's fast-forward to be69bf68, the snapshots, thuum's merge commit, Eli's world, playtest fifteen, Eli's approvals. m2-relay sits on 31b56fc9 and is not in tonight's merge." tooltip="Source: scratchpad stage2-chain.out, stage3-chain.sh, merge-chain.sh, merge-m2-visuals.sh, visuals-chain.out, spellvis-chain.out; docs/verbs/poison.md:275-293; thuum de09fdc; git log (vis-wt, relay-wt)" id="lc2-stat">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="1190" height="64" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;m2-relay&lt;/b&gt; on m2-visuals 31b56fc9 (not its head), head 184bcc6f" tooltip="Source: git -C scratchpad/relay-wt log 31b56fc9..origin/m2-relay (1 commit)" id="lc2-relay">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="188" width="1190" height="94" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;184bcc6f&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 00:43 [server, unit]&lt;br&gt;Every spell cast relayed as the server resolved it (RelayCast: its caster a form id, to every listener but the sender, reliably), its end included; SpellCastTest names the caster; spell-cast's difftest declarations to redraw from its first T2." tooltip="Source: git show 184bcc6f (fork, worktree relay-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-relay-184bcc6f">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-relay">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="30" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Not in tonight's merge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;m2-relay sits on 31b56fc9, three commits below the head be69bf68; merge-chain.sh sweeps be69bf68 and fast-forwards parity only to it, the parity playtest fifteen plays. No pipeline, T2 or lab run of 184bcc6f read here." tooltip="Source: git (relay-wt): 184bcc6f's parent is 31b56fc9, and 0f4e3b75, ae8446a9, be69bf68 are not in m2-relay; scratchpad merge-chain.sh:9; merge-m2-visuals.sh:75; playtest-m2-15.md:3" id="lc2-relay-g">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-relay">
            <mxGeometry x="590" y="30" width="590" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="lc2-relay-g-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;PENDING&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-relay-g">
          <mxGeometry x="532" y="3" width="52" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;m2-visuals&lt;/b&gt; on m2-poison 40ed43a5, head be69bf68: fourteen's visual fixes and dual casting" tooltip="Source: git -C scratchpad/vis-wt log origin/m2-poison..origin/m2-visuals (12 commits); docs/PLAN.md:952-968 (the visual fixes, dual casting)" id="lc2-vis">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="306" width="1190" height="691" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;be69bf68&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 01:35 [client]&lt;br&gt;A hit from any actor counts nothing to the player in its own game (fDiffMultHPToPC* 0), as ADR-028 has the server compute all damage (x-uf-ethereal: Unrelenting Force took 50, the server's hit 10)." tooltip="Source: git show be69bf68 (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-be69bf68">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="30" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;ae8446a9&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 01:31 [client]&lt;br&gt;A figure's spell that lands on this game's player is dispelled at its hit: what it does to the player is the server's (x-shout-relay: Fire Breath took c2's game to 0.34, the server counted half)." tooltip="Source: git show ae8446a9 (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-ae8446a9">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="88" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;0f4e3b75&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 01:28 [skyrim-platform]&lt;br&gt;The spellCast event gives a cast to the hand that began casting since the last cast event, so a second hand's cast of the same spell no longer replaces the first's stream (x-dual-cast3)." tooltip="Source: git show 0f4e3b75 (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-0f4e3b75">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="146" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;31b56fc9&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 00:35 [skyrim-platform]&lt;br&gt;castSpellImmediate casts a spell of Self delivery on its actor, so a relayed self spell shows on the caster's figure (x-self-visuals: Invisibility, Oakflesh, Candlelight showed nothing)." tooltip="Source: git show 31b56fc9 (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-31b56fc9">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="204" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;2b6dd88f&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 00:13 [server, client, unit, difftest]&lt;br&gt;The shout relay reaches an observer's figure: the server relays the cast it resolved (the shouter's form id, not 0x14) to every game but the shouter's; the shout carries its graph variables." tooltip="Source: git show 2b6dd88f (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-2b6dd88f">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="262" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;717b071d&lt;/b&gt; 10-13 00:10 [client]&lt;br&gt;A shout's cast carries its shouter's facing as its aim (an observer's figure launched it north)." tooltip="Source: git show 717b071d (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-717b071d">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="320" width="560" height="39" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;7da7210f&lt;/b&gt; 10-12 23:47 [client]&lt;br&gt;A magic hit's double is dropped by frame, not by the caster's last 100 ms, so a second hand's hits reach the server (dual casting's client half)." tooltip="Source: git show 7da7210f (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-7da7210f">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="365" width="560" height="52" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;674c8a23&lt;/b&gt; 10-12 23:41 [unit]&lt;br&gt;PoisonTest's first include block in order (the fork's Formatting check)." tooltip="Source: git show 674c8a23 (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-674c8a23">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lc2-vis">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="423" width="560" height="39" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;1abfda55&lt;/b&gt; 10-12 23:39 [wire-rules]&lt;br&gt;With a stream of one spell in each hand, a hit claims the stream whose last counted hit is oldest: each hand's stream counts its own time." tooltip="Source: git show 1abfda55 (fork, worktree vis-wt): its message and --stat" id="lc2-vis-1abfda55">
